{"architectures":["neutral","x64","x86"],"id":"JTL.Wawi","latestVersion":"2.0.0","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"JTL-Wawi ist eine kostenlose Warenwirtschaftssoftware für den E-Commerce","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://www.jtl-software.de/agb","locale":"de-DE","localizations":{"de-DE":{"description":"JTL-Wawi ist eine kostenlose Warenwirtschaftssoftware für den E-Commerce","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://www.jtl-software.de/agb","locale":"de-DE","longDescription":"JTL-Wawi ist eine kostenlose, leistungsstarke Warenwirtschaftssoftware für den E-Commerce.\nSie verwaltet Artikel, Bestellungen, Kunden, Lieferanten und Lager zentral.\n\nFeatures:\n- Artikelverwaltung mit Variationen und Sets\n- Multichannel-Anbindung (Amazon, eBay, Shops, etc.)\n- Lagerverwaltung mit Inventur\n- Versandabwicklung und Tracking\n- DATEV-Export und Rechnungswesen\n- POS-Integration (JTL-POS)\n- Reporting und Statistiken\n\nSystemvoraussetzungen:\n- Windows 10/11 oder Windows Server 2019/2022\n- .NET 8 Desktop Runtime (wird automatisch installiert)\n- Microsoft SQL Server (Express, Standard, Enterprise) oder SQL Server LocalDB\n- 4 GB RAM (8 GB empfohlen)\n- 2 GB freier Festplattenspeicher","name":"JTL-Wawi","packageUrl":"https://www.jtl-software.de/","publisher":"JTL-Software GmbH","publisherUrl":"https://www.jtl-software.de/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://guide.jtl-software.de/changelog/","tags":["erp","warenwirtschaft","e-commerce","lager","bestellverwaltung","artikelverwaltung","multichannel","amazon","ebay","shop","versand","inventur","buchhaltung","pos"]},"en-US":{"description":"JTL-Wawi is a free ERP software for e-commerce","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://www.jtl-software.de/agb","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"JTL-Wawi is a free, powerful ERP software for e-commerce.\nIt manages products, orders, customers, suppliers, and warehouses centrally.\n\nFeatures:\n- Product management with variations and sets\n- Multichannel integration (Amazon, eBay, shops, etc.)\n- Warehouse management with inventory\n- Shipping processing and tracking\n- Invoice and accounting export\n- POS integration (JTL-POS)\n- Reporting and statistics\n\nSystem Requirements:\n- Windows 10/11 or Windows Server 2019/2022\n- .NET 8 Desktop Runtime (installed automatically)\n- Microsoft SQL Server (Express, Standard, Enterprise) or SQL Server LocalDB\n- 4 GB RAM (8 GB recommended)\n- 2 GB free disk space","name":"JTL-Wawi","packageUrl":"https://www.jtl-software.de/","publisher":"JTL-Software GmbH","publisherUrl":"https://www.jtl-software.de/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://guide.jtl-software.de/changelog/","tags":["erp","warehouse","e-commerce","inventory","order-management","product-management","multichannel","amazon","ebay","shop","shipping","accounting","pos"]}},"longDescription":"JTL-Wawi ist eine kostenlose, leistungsstarke Warenwirtschaftssoftware für den E-Commerce.\nSie verwaltet Artikel, Bestellungen, Kunden, Lieferanten und Lager zentral.\n\nFeatures:\n- Artikelverwaltung mit Variationen und Sets\n- Multichannel-Anbindung (Amazon, eBay, Shops, etc.)\n- Lagerverwaltung mit Inventur\n- Versandabwicklung und Tracking\n- DATEV-Export und Rechnungswesen\n- POS-Integration (JTL-POS)\n- Reporting und Statistiken\n\nSystemvoraussetzungen:\n- Windows 10/11 oder Windows Server 2019/2022\n- .NET 8 Desktop Runtime (wird automatisch installiert)\n- Microsoft SQL Server (Express, Standard, Enterprise) oder SQL Server LocalDB\n- 4 GB RAM (8 GB empfohlen)\n- 2 GB freier Festplattenspeicher","name":"JTL-Wawi","packageUrl":"https://www.jtl-software.de/","publisher":"JTL-Software GmbH","publisherUrl":"https://www.jtl-software.de/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://guide.jtl-software.de/changelog/","tags":["erp","warenwirtschaft","e-commerce","lager","bestellverwaltung","artikelverwaltung","multichannel","amazon","ebay","shop","versand","inventur","buchhaltung","pos"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architec